g tinggi, dan Kami beri minum kamu dengan air tawar?"},{"n":28,"w":[["وَيْلٌۭ","kecelakaan","waylun",294],["يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","pada hari itu","yawma-idhin",177],["لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","bagi orang-orang yang mendustakan","lil'mukadhibīna",494]],"t":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran)."},{"n":29,"w":[["ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟","pergilah kamu","inṭaliqū",949],["إِلَىٰ","kepada","ilā",13],["مَا","apa","mā",2],["كُنتُم","kalian adalah","kuntum",9],["بِهِۦ","dengannya/padanya","bihi",17],["تُكَذِّبُونَ","kamu mendustakan","tukadhibūna",63]],"t":"(Akan dikatakan), \"Pergilah kamu guna mendapatkan apa (azab) yang dahulu kamu dustakan."},{"n":30,"w":[["ٱنطَلِقُوٓا۟","pergilah kamu","inṭaliqū",949],["إِلَىٰ","kepada","ilā",13],["ظِلٍّۢ","naungan","ẓillin",662],["ذِى","mempunyai","dhī",113],["ثَلَـٰثِ","tiga","thalāthi",1008],["شُعَبٍۢ","cabang","shuʿabin",2892]],"t":"Pergilah kamu mendapatkan naungan (asap api neraka) yang mempunyai tiga cabang,"},{"n":31,"w":[["لَّا","tidak","lā",4],["ظَلِيلٍۢ","menaungi","ẓalīlin",2324],["وَلَا","dan tidak","walā",4],["يُغْنِى","berguna/menolak","yugh'nī",384],["مِنَ","dari","mina",0],["ٱللَّهَبِ","nyala api neraka","l-lahabi",1876]],"t":"yang tidak melindungi dan tidak pula menolak nyala api neraka.\""},{"n":32,"w":[["إِنَّهَا","sesungguhnya ia","innahā",5],["تَرْمِى","melemparkan","tarmī",923],["بِشَرَرٍۢ","bunga api","bishararin",2878],["كَٱلْقَصْرِ","seperti istana/gedung tinggi","kal-qaṣri",1621]],"t":"Sungguh, (neraka) itu menyemburkan bunga api (sebesar dan setinggi) istana,"},{"n":33,"w":[["كَأَنَّهُۥ","seolah-olah ia","ka-annahu",376],["جِمَـٰلَتٌۭ","unta-unta","jimālatun",3557],["صُفْرٌۭ","kuning","ṣuf'run",3287]],"t":"seakan-akan iring-iringan unta yang kuning."},{"n":34,"w":[["وَيْلٌۭ","kecelakaan","waylun",294],["يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","pada hari itu","yawma-idhin",177],["لِّلْمُكَذِّبِينَ","bagi orang-orang yang mendustakan","lil'mukadhibīna",494]],"t":"Celakalah pada hari itu, bagi mereka yang mendustakan (kebenaran)."},{"